  "description": "Jeong-Ha is adopted by a family of powerful mediums and grows up with Ji-Han, his affectionate older brother. But later, he learns he's being used as a human shield to absorb bad luck and protect Ji-Han. Feeling betrayed, Jeong-Ha tries to cut ties with Ji-Han and his family by running away. But Ji-Han's obsession with Jeong-Ha leads him to use drastic measures to force him back into his arms... \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
